---
subject: "Your PropFlow password was changed"
preheader: "Your password was just changed and other devices were signed out."
---
{%- comment -%} After a password reset. Data: name, ip, changed_at, reset_url {%- endcomment -%}
{% layout "email" %}
{% block content %}
<h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;{{ style.h1 }}">Your password was changed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;{{ style.p }}">Hi {{ name | first_name }},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;{{ style.p }}">The password for your PropFlow account was just changed, and every device signed in to your account was signed out.</p>
{% capture note %}The change was made from <strong style="color:{{ color.ink }};">{{ ip | default: "an unknown address" }}</strong> at <strong style="color:{{ color.ink }};">{{ changed_at | pkt_time }}</strong>. Reset your password straight away and let your administrator know.{% endcapture %}
{% render "security", title: "Wasn't you?", body: note %}
<div style="height:24px;"></div>
{% render "button", label: "Reset password", href: reset_url %}
{% endblock %}
